        370.7314147949219,
        50.106937408447266
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We next fix a functional Vol : Rnθ →R that represents the volume of R(θ). This motivates the",
      "bbox": [
        106.93597412109375,
        91.08624267578125,
        522.0028686523438,
        104.17741394042969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "following scenario program:",
      "bbox": [
        90.0,
        107.97368621826172,
        213.94920349121094,
        117.72642517089844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "minimize",
      "bbox": [
        208.4810028076172,
        129.419677734375,
        249.69557189941406,
        139.1724090576172
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
