        311.4996032714844,
        175.63519287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "{θi : g(δ(i), θi) ≤0}",
      "bbox": [
        312.35699462890625,
        150.78973388671875,
        403.5185241699219,
        164.57736206054688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(6)",
      "bbox": [
        509.27996826171875,
        147.36163330078125,
        522.0,
        157.11436462402344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The violation probability, V (R(θ)), of (6) may be interpreted as the probability that an unseen",
      "bbox": [
        89.99996948242188,
        186.3302001953125,
        521.996337890625,
        196.86839294433594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "scenario will violate the bounds of the reachable set estimate. Our goal is to select θ such that the",
      "bbox": [
        89.99996948242188,
        200.4901123046875,
        522.0021362304688,
        210.4174041748047
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "probability of V (R(θ)) > ϵ is less than or equal to β while minimizing Vol(θ).",
      "bbox": [
        89.99996948242188,
        213.42822265625,
        436.41424560546875,
        223.96641540527344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed problem (6) can be equivalently expressed in the functional form",
      "bbox": [
        106.93597412109375,
        227.763671875,
        451.91424560546875,
        237.5164031982422
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "minimize",
      "bbox": [
        218.76597595214844,
        249.20965576171875,
        259.98052978515625,
        258.9623718261719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "θ",
      "bbox": [
        237.27996826171875,
        258.55279541015625,
        241.23313903808594,
        265.6302490234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vol(θ)",
      "bbox": [
        270.84796142578125,
        249.03509521484375,
        300.5166015625,
        258.7223815917969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "subject to",
      "bbox": [
